Dear Zhengyu,

On Mon, 22 Jul 2013, zhengyu jiang wrote:

> Hi Gordon,
>
> Sorry to bother you again.  I have two questions.
>
> (1) I started the "eset<-as.matrix(log(M)) #### take log intensities" 
