Dear Simon,

Yes, the F3/F5 protocol is supported by Subread. You will need to set PE_orientation="ff" when you run align or subjunc functions. This will tell the alignment programs that the two reads from the same pair are on the same strand and they can then be handled properly.

Sorry the documentation did not provide enough details about how to map such reads. I have just added more descriptions to this to the help pages and user guide to make them more clearer.

Best wishes,

Wei

